      "title": "Research state for no-three-in-line at grid size 77",
      "summary": "For the 77 by 77 grid, the exact maximum remains unresolved with certified interval 152 ≤ D(77) ≤ 154. An exact 152-point certificate supplies the lower bound, while row capacity supplies the upper bound. Current durable work covers exact certificates and extremal occupancy, local rigidity around specified record embeddings, and symmetry-restricted analysis.",
