      "title": "Exact 152-point certificate in G_76",
      "summary": "An exact executable certificate establishes a 152-point no-three-in-line subset of G_76. The integer-arithmetic verifier checks distinctness, coordinate bounds, and nonzero determinants for all 573,800 triples. Inclusion into G_77 yields D(77) ≥ 152. A proposed hosted replay lacks execution attestation, and its provenance pointer contains a clerical error, neither of which changes the mathematical implication.",
