      "nodeType": "result",
      "title": "Necessary occupancy conditions at cardinalities 153 and 154",
      "summary": "Any 154-point no-three-in-line subset of G_77 must have exactly two points in every row and column. Any 153-point subset must have two points in 76 rows and one point in the remaining row, with the analogous column pattern. These are necessary conditions only and establish neither existence nor impossibility.",
