      "title": "Symmetry orbit and eight specified embeddings of the G_76 record",
      "summary": "The specified 152-point record is invariant under a quarter-turn and has exactly two distinct dihedral images. Applying the four translations in {0,1}² to those images produces exactly eight distinct subsets of G_77. The result is limited to these specified dihedral-and-translation embeddings.",
