      "nodeType": "lemma",
      "title": "Classification of nontrivial rotations preserving finite noncollinear lattice sets",
      "summary": "If a finite noncollinear subset of the integer lattice is preserved by a nonidentity Euclidean rotation about an arbitrary center, that rotation is a half-turn or quarter-turn. The result concerns exact rotations and does not classify reflections, affine maps, approximate symmetries, or degenerate finite sets.",
