      "nodeType": "method",
      "title": "Exact rct4 model for a 154-point configuration in G_77",
      "summary": "The supplied n=77 model is sound and complete for its stated 154-point rct4 subclass, using 1,444 off-diagonal quarter-turn-orbit variables, 38 main-diagonal half-turn-pair variables, exact cardinality constraints, and 388,148 deduplicated line constraints. Calibration certificates validate implementation behavior at five listed sizes. The model does not represent every centered-half-turn or every 154-point configuration.",
