      "title": "Satisfiability of the n=77 154-point rct4 instance",
      "summary": "The satisfiability of the n=77 rct4 model remains unresolved. Reported CP-SAT UNKNOWN outcomes and SAT timeouts establish neither satisfiability nor unsatisfiability. A feasible assignment would imply D(77)=154, while certified infeasibility would exclude only the rct4 subclass.",
